"                                                world of animation. Not one, actually,\n"
"                                                but many. To be honest, entire\n"
"                                                universes! Today we create\n"
"                                                entertainment content for\n"
"                                                <strong>Cartoon Network, Cartoonito, Comedy\n"
"                                                Central, Canal Futura, Sanrio, Disney\n"
"                                                Jr., Instituto Ayrton Senna, Mauricio\n"
"                                                de Sousa Produções, Wonder Media, Midas\n"
"                                                Music</strong>\n"
"                                                and\n"
"                                                <strong>Future Channel</strong>, among\n"
"                                                others. We're constantly adapting our\n"
"                                                pipelines to deliver the best-animated\n"
"                                                story yet."
